{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are 24 four-digit whole numbers that use each of the four digits 2, 4, 5 and 7 exactly once. Only one of these four-digit numbers is a multiple of another one. Which of the following is it?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b47282ad7c88f3cfc089491e9261f4482993d7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5724 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 7245 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 7254 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7425 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 7542$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest number formed from these four digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/08378f218d0cd59bccb4c333fb973fe8463c366f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2457$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> while the largest is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8bb03468f3eb26d54239cde2a2bcf3ce94ee4a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7542$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8c1d35e4540b36f6f1524e6f1ec701ef6fe6e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7542 &lt; 2457 \\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />, the correct answer must be either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times another number containing these four digits.\n</p><p>By inspection, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae14f8e0f4d8842a3e3db338aaf4f80d8d692e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7425}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" /> is correct since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d2066616b65a3271d0f4e7dd78644e84466b0b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7425 \\div 3 = 2475$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>(A) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a8a1ce340761b5431366711e781b9744e5cd73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5724 \\div 2 = 2862$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/8/8f881b596b5ade40fa88626698474fec57b2b78a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5724 \\div 3 = 1908$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>(B) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8f6d26f51426e54ca3bb08d684e06d0af2295b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7245 \\div 3 = 2415$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>(C) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15a835a543535d48d84cf3656116396cdede8d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7254 \\div 2 = 3627$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/65820189d4a08ce9704b09c6cff78e8878fba979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7254 \\div 3 = 2418$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>(E) is incorrect since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f0c7248cecefc8ec401d9cd85f1a905298d790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7542 \\div 2 = 3771$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/6/2169e95ccc972e2b8e7c2c8a3b09f4ac2c33c492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7542 \\div 3 = 2514$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~ M4ST3R0FM4TH with minor corrections from Pi-rate_X, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> be four-digit integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad37fb2f3070e229367d5ef8649dcbc83db644f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{A, B, C, D\\}=\\{W, X, Y, Z\\}=\\{2,4,5,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"329\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  As in solution 1, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e9e9438723dbf20977753c5c36d0f0bcce284c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946fedbe6aa63ac06cef32d850bc5dd8b7547671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 3 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e9e9438723dbf20977753c5c36d0f0bcce284c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c13d77e2b5ede10a622c2229043191de82ce17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, since otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e732f4786b2de055e8cdd2532935ba4be76f774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> is too large.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5aba169d0b5debef5cd3b92158929a6f6c6eb2d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0591b54746d40d0a11da8371abcdd49096e31b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313c4b7c086f78494ed7afafd12ff89bac71a6ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b0287b1ce7e75f849c3eb5d92e9066bb7b4b1d0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> which is invalid.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f52d3c082c817c3838b37b7d7a7f459bc642c09c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c2ca6808b334fe5611f6164f3b07c757227be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10cb764f88509fb1c8012366993fdbee98f31bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7eebd3d5447f387d9fc5a668a8785b1b7dcfbdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d8507e068f6074da955898d65e3be5973685166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8d13ed8da100341a226c881f5844a78a88118d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> is too small, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22baac45709f59068286eec82ab9a4a82101582d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf96892e4c0821f127102dee41517a58d9086cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 7$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf5b356fbfb0f0627e2165beea96f0313976e14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD = 2547$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"14\" />.  But in this case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4381df850cbe329c672d424b3c694acc062596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times ABCD = 5094$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />, which is invalid.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946fedbe6aa63ac06cef32d850bc5dd8b7547671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 3 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.  \n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c13d77e2b5ede10a622c2229043191de82ce17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, since otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba9d8907a5670a89c1608b54818f19fe9372a933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> is too large.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92e3d0a342cedbff3cbc989596f5907ac3f15f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8af927a622a491e6f6bb04d2ff053f797da1a1c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD &gt; 2700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d7209ca78bab1e819e5594abbb39630eedf87c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ &gt; 3 \\times 2700 = 8100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" /> which is too large.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f52d3c082c817c3838b37b7d7a7f459bc642c09c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/86045455c73c248ce17567ca58cee5f89042d058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> which is invalid.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf96892e4c0821f127102dee41517a58d9086cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 7$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d8507e068f6074da955898d65e3be5973685166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0591b54746d40d0a11da8371abcdd49096e31b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d978debd1c9bab14db535c6c4fe9cde8ea9c835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ = 3 \\times 2574 = 7722$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"219\" height=\"16\" /> which is invalid.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22baac45709f59068286eec82ab9a4a82101582d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5aba169d0b5debef5cd3b92158929a6f6c6eb2d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c4e65394d61673beb2f3787d0af401df4fa8315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ = 3 \\times 2475 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7425}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"265\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> be four-digit integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad37fb2f3070e229367d5ef8649dcbc83db644f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{A, B, C, D\\}=\\{W, X, Y, Z\\}=\\{2,4,5,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"329\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />.  As in solution 1, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e9e9438723dbf20977753c5c36d0f0bcce284c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946fedbe6aa63ac06cef32d850bc5dd8b7547671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 3 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53e9e9438723dbf20977753c5c36d0f0bcce284c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c131ab09bf65049d1708db2b9ec9da540dccbebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\geq 2457$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4c0c794506bc87046ce3e72ff3c3a4b06de44d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 2457 \\times 2 = 4914$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"219\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe40266c3cd2dc8b84ebaf031dccc9e78d461b8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5274$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> is the smallest possible even value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> which is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3117a311fe001bb5c57afe0fe7ee7d66512dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4914$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34effc6e70966d9b3f8736277e3299c4c34b9a1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 5274$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2967a6c0d51857d8dd3c8f99bfc7a8ec89feb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 7542$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0a422e5ac5ac09e93ccc644a698487ba6eafeec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 7542 \\div 2 = 3761$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"213\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/9/599c2753a15f72a5cad37bf5b5caf5a9536bc507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2754$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> which is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d5345585be32a66292535eb0b38cc59a2fa610f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3761$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273f0d6cb18911ddf3beaf6bd4d341f1f64e25d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2754$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273f0d6cb18911ddf3beaf6bd4d341f1f64e25d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2754$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d63255736297b3f587a7ed649138e481637548b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2754 \\times 2= 5508$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"213\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f59d31c8ebc99131b263e8c413542ba9fcb32be2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5472$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is the largest possible even value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> which is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72ddbfda197953c88e071c36fc7ee5ac8c42f28c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5508$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc375a00b499bab8de89c59f1ba163a194b82c1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 5472$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc375a00b499bab8de89c59f1ba163a194b82c1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 5472$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/3445b54fc2ecb789b6e5dd2dec7c484c79272d5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 5472 \\div 2 = 2736$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"213\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f45c7328185ac321e273639fa188b98c2b1149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2574$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> which is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b67a3d16b93619bdbe7eaf59f085ea0a5895a157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2736$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/237160f0101221447698af1486d85fb8e81d7bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2574$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/237160f0101221447698af1486d85fb8e81d7bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2574$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/685affda8781fff7e63ed4954a0091fe5f86a3e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 2574 \\times 2 = 5148$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"219\" height=\"17\" />.  But it is impossible for both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34effc6e70966d9b3f8736277e3299c4c34b9a1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 5274$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/7586b86fb6c97f5e9bee01ef888fb03527eb0441.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 5148$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a0216cec1fa458d2c974222bfbaa8a9a999897b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 2 \\neq WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/946fedbe6aa63ac06cef32d850bc5dd8b7547671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\times 3 = WXYZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c131ab09bf65049d1708db2b9ec9da540dccbebc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\geq 2457$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/348bc1dce642dd1328235966eaf35477dac1a928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 2457 \\times 3 = 7371$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"219\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2e26bdd038868f18e1b9c441208bad28dab064f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7425$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b076f2e7f124fc5d8b5ef7b30b95bfcfe85449f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" /> which is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/1105f5795012dc2e1c770746210777288255b40e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7371$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e2c6a7a159ce3431b876829b296aec57e5831f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 7425$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2967a6c0d51857d8dd3c8f99bfc7a8ec89feb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 7542$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be842cd973ddfc81aa655368d2003e348b2a4b72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 7542 \\div 3 = 2514$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"213\" height=\"17\" />.  Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/f/acfb127b520492bdd0b5a11eb3824d79a246f505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2475$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> which is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a196367fe41ed3196c3f5aee3035792656e1946c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2514$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c4b792f74a9d71b7a9a8e3b60c8f9882492d33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2475$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c4b792f74a9d71b7a9a8e3b60c8f9882492d33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD \\leq 2475$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c929dc8b0fd10472a5e42ec52e8ea57f03801c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 2475 \\times 3 = 7425$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"219\" height=\"17\" />.  Since both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e2c6a7a159ce3431b876829b296aec57e5831f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\geq 7425$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9b8ec28bc969e20b076042b55a3fadba68389f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ \\leq 7425$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/d/4dd7bb8a999465a19caa88cf5bca77a65b926c1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WXYZ = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7425}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"173\" height=\"30\" /> (and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f3a88d89844d85987bf64f693eae19192f1e8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD = 7425 \\div 3 = 2475$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"213\" height=\"16\" />).\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last<br />Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Proble